# 🔐 SESSION_ID & TOKEN are INVISIBLE

## ✅ Environment Variables (Railway Only)

```env
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_token_here
SESSION_ID=****hidden****
BOT_NAME=SIMON
BOT_PREFIX=.
OWNER_NUMBER=+1234567890
NODE_ENV=production
```

---

## 🚀 How Hidden Variables Work

### config.js - Masks all sensitive data

```javascript
// Never logged in console:
safeConfig.SESSION_ID = '****hidden****';
safeConfig.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN = '****hidden****';
```

### Result in Console

```
✅ Telegram Bot Controller Started
🤖 Bot Name: SIMON
🔐 TOKEN: ****hidden****
```

---

## 📱 Telegram Commands After Setup

| Command | Function |
|---------|----------|
| `/start` | Welcome + linking instructions |
| `/pair` | Link your WhatsApp number |
| `/help` | Show all available commands |
| `/status` | Check WhatsApp linking status |
| `/ping` | Check bot response time |
| `/alive` | Show bot status & uptime |
| `/unlink` | Remove WhatsApp link |

